CRT rename replacement regression
=================================

Run: python3 developer/debug/test/crt/stdc/rename_atomic_host.py

The test compiles the production rename body under ASan/UBSan with DOS
operation fixtures. It checks normal rename, successful native replacement,
unsupported replacement, replacement failure, zero-error fallback and preserved
native errors. Both file values survive every failed operation. The fixture
intentionally provides no DeleteFile or scheduler exclusion API.

Also run developer/debug/test/dos/rename_replace_paths_host.py to cover the
actual DOS Rename/ReplaceObject bodies with rooted assigns, balanced ownership
and classic/fast BSTR failure paths. Host fixtures do not qualify a filesystem's
atomic replacement implementation or persistence after reset.
